{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d9d62268-9a21-81ed-8747-c99ff0c882f4",
  "created_at": "2026-03-06T10:04:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ellen Gifford",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:59:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:59:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. I need to know if someone can come look at the storm drain on my street. Water's coming up out of it and into my cellar."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:00:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no. Okay, let's get you taken care of. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:00:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "17 Mill Street, up on the Hill. The drain's right out front, by the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:00:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 17 Mill. Is this from the rain today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:00:26-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the rain that's coming down right now. It started this morning and it's been steady. The drain is just overflowing, and a few inches of water came into the cellar. Bottom line, that has never happened since we've been in this house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:00:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few inches, okay. Is the water still coming in, or has it stopped?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:00:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's slowing down, I think, but the street is still pooling. I just went down and looked and it's maybe two inches on the floor by the back wall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:01:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Are you safe in the house? Nothing electrical down there sitting in the water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:01:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The washer and dryer are down there, but I shut the breaker off before I went down. I'm not standing in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:01:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, that's smart. Stay out of it until it drains off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:01:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Also, can you tell me when someone last came by to clean that drain? Like, was it done recently? Because it looks packed with leaves and junk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:01:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can look at the work history for Mill Street while you're on. Hang on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:01:40-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:01:41-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, I'm in the system. I'm not seeing a cleaning logged for that block recently. Nothing that comes up for the last while, anyway. That doesn't always mean nothing was done, but it's not showing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:01:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So nobody's been by. Great. Honestly that's what I figured."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:02:00-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand why that's frustrating. I'm going to put in a request for a crew to check and clear it, and I'll mark it as water getting into a home so it gets looked at sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:02:14-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. And can I say, I'm worried about the street itself. There's a lot of water pooled out there, and kids walk through here to get to the bus, and people walk dogs. You can't see where the drain opening is anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:02:31-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a good point to flag. I'll put that in the notes, that the drain is covered by standing water and people are walking past it. If it gets worse and anyone's in danger, call 911 for that part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:02:47-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Sorry if I'm blunt. We just moved here from Fall River not long ago and I'm still learning the streets, so I wasn't sure who to call. Is this the right department?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:03:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not at all, and yes, this is exactly the right place for a drain. Storm drains are ours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:03:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So when will somebody actually come?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:03:12-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Today's going to be hard, with the rain still falling and every drain in the city overflowing. Realistically I'd say sometime over the next day or two, and sooner if they can spare a truck. I'd rather tell you that straight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:03:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A day or two. Okay. I just want it on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:03:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It'll be on the list. Can I get a good number for you in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:03:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0171."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:03:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Five-five-five, zero-one-seven-one, with the 401. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:03:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:03:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And it's Ellen, correct? Last name Gifford?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:03:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Ellen Gifford. G-I-F-F-O-R-D."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:03:57-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Request is in for 17 Mill Street, drain backing up, water in the cellar, standing water a hazard to pedestrians. If it gets deeper in the house, call us right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:04:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:04:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ellen. Stay dry."
    }
  ],
